WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.430
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.700 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.070 --> 01:51.000
[Episode 11]

4
01:55.420 --> 01:57.400
Someone actually secretly took photos?

5
01:57.400 --> 01:58.310
Uncle and Lili

6
01:58.310 --> 01:59.450
are quite a match.

7
02:01.120 --> 02:02.200
I was only gone for a little while,

8
02:02.200 --> 02:04.330
and they've made such rapid progress.

9
02:05.920 --> 02:06.480
It's just that dating

10
02:06.480 --> 02:07.290
is really tough

11
02:07.290 --> 02:08.750
for these two introverts.

12
02:09.520 --> 02:10.380
Hey, handsome!

13
02:10.620 --> 02:11.280
We've met before

14
02:11.280 --> 02:12.500
at EAW.

15
02:22.750 --> 02:23.620
Are you okay?

16
02:25.750 --> 02:27.400
Call... Call an ambulance.

17
02:42.090 --> 02:43.000
Fu Zhengchu!

18
02:43.210 --> 02:44.020
I...

19
02:46.300 --> 02:48.210
How did you get hurt so badly?

20
02:48.650 --> 02:50.370
Let alone skateboarding,

21
02:50.410 --> 02:51.940
even walking is a struggle.

22
02:53.620 --> 02:55.020
For the rest of your life,

23
02:55.150 --> 02:57.810
you won't be confined to a wheelchair, will you?

24
03:00.210 --> 03:01.020
Tang Lin.

25
03:03.300 --> 03:04.090
I'm here.

26
03:08.800 --> 03:09.500
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

27
03:09.500 --> 03:11.230
I mistook you for someone else.

28
03:17.760 --> 03:19.610
Well, how's your leg?

29
03:20.500 --> 03:21.210
It's fine.

30
03:21.210 --> 03:21.910
It'll be better in a few days.

31
03:21.910 --> 03:22.650
Minor issue.

32
03:22.750 --> 03:23.560
Don't worry.

33
03:33.400 --> 03:35.860
You even snatched a patient's potato chips?

34
03:36.690 --> 03:37.500
Forget it.

35
03:38.000 --> 03:39.120
A real man doesn't pick fights with women.

36
03:39.120 --> 03:40.820
Fine, you can have this bag of chips.

37
03:40.820 --> 03:42.270
Too proud to admit it.

38
03:44.810 --> 03:45.620
But

39
03:45.620 --> 03:46.400
why didn't my sister

40
03:46.400 --> 03:47.300
come with you?

41
03:47.710 --> 03:48.750
Xia is busy.

42
03:48.750 --> 03:50.000
She asked me to come see you.

43
03:50.000 --> 03:51.260
She'll be here in a bit.

44
03:58.300 --> 03:59.020
I'm a little thirsty.

45
03:59.020 --> 04:00.690
Can you pour me some water?

46
04:01.000 --> 04:02.800
You want me to pour water for you?

47
04:03.590 --> 04:05.120
I'm injured, aren't I?

48
04:05.120 --> 04:06.150
And it's hard to move my leg.

49
04:06.150 --> 04:07.750
Just help me pour some water.

50
04:11.500 --> 04:12.300
Help.

51
04:15.240 --> 04:16.300
Alright, alright.

52
04:17.000 --> 04:18.600
I'll pour some water for you.

53
04:32.750 --> 04:34.120
How exactly did you fall

54
04:34.120 --> 04:35.320
to get hurt like this?

55
04:38.980 --> 04:39.770
Well,

56
04:40.480 --> 04:42.070
there was this really ill-mannered person

57
04:42.070 --> 04:44.630
who actually threw a banana peel on the road,

58
04:44.650 --> 04:45.770
causing me to fall.

59
04:46.270 --> 04:47.370
Otherwise, with my skills,

60
04:47.370 --> 04:48.600
I would never fall.

61
04:48.890 --> 04:50.300
What banana peel?

62
04:50.500 --> 04:51.390
I think you just

63
04:51.390 --> 04:52.370
thought you were so skilled

64
04:52.370 --> 04:53.800
that you were scrolling on your phone

65
04:53.800 --> 04:56.100
while skateboarding and fell into a pit, right?

66
04:56.100 --> 04:56.930
How did you...

67
04:58.990 --> 05:00.720
You must be Zhengchu's sister.

68
05:01.330 --> 05:02.130
Hello.

69
05:02.270 --> 05:03.500
Just call me Feifei.

70
05:03.500 --> 05:04.240
Zhengchu,

71
05:04.240 --> 05:05.240
I've paid the fees.

72
05:05.240 --> 05:06.190
I'll be leaving now.

73
05:06.190 --> 05:06.930
Thanks.

74
05:06.930 --> 05:07.800
I'll transfer the money to you later.

75
05:07.800 --> 05:08.830
Thanks for your help today.

76
05:08.830 --> 05:10.180
Then I'll come see you again tomorrow.

77
05:10.180 --> 05:10.630
Okay.

78
05:11.690 --> 05:12.590
Goodbye, Sister.

79
05:12.590 --> 05:13.410
Who is...

80
05:15.370 --> 05:16.370
Who is her sister?

81
05:16.890 --> 05:17.690
Fu Zhengchu,

82
05:18.480 --> 05:19.600
who is she?

83
05:21.500 --> 05:23.570
The knife. Move it back a bit.

84
05:27.730 --> 05:28.530
Who is she?

85
05:29.890 --> 05:31.390
She's my lifesaver.

86
05:31.690 --> 05:32.800
Lifesaver?

87
05:32.800 --> 05:33.330
Is your next line

88
05:33.330 --> 05:34.600
going to be that you have nothing to repay her with,

89
05:34.600 --> 05:36.100
so you'll offer yourself to her?

90
05:36.100 --> 05:37.370
Have you been reading

91
05:37.370 --> 05:38.570
too many novels?

92
05:38.830 --> 05:40.300
I fell into a pit,

93
05:40.300 --> 05:40.930
and she saved me

94
05:40.930 --> 05:42.240
and even called an ambulance for me.

95
05:42.240 --> 05:43.570
You didn't look where you were going, did you?

96
05:43.570 --> 05:45.430
You deserved to fall into the pit.

97
05:47.600 --> 05:49.600
What kind of nonsense is that?

98
05:54.690 --> 05:55.980
Do you know what I saw?

99
05:56.330 --> 05:57.100
Someone posted photos of Uncle

100
05:57.100 --> 05:58.150
and Lili

101
05:58.170 --> 05:59.050
online.

102
05:59.100 --> 06:00.300
What are you talking—

103
06:01.390 --> 06:02.830
Look, they're such a good match.

104
06:02.830 --> 06:05.560
Their eyes were practically glued to each other.

105
06:08.680 --> 06:09.830
What do you know?

106
06:10.180 --> 06:11.830
These are pink bubbles,

107
06:11.900 --> 06:13.100
the feeling of love.

108
06:14.800 --> 06:15.430
These two

109
06:15.430 --> 06:16.630
can finally be together

110
06:16.630 --> 06:17.390
openly.

111
06:17.600 --> 06:18.730
The feeling of love.

112
06:22.280 --> 06:23.700
Why are you copying me?

113
06:31.360 --> 06:32.150
Mrs. Jiang.

114
06:32.680 --> 06:33.720
How is Grandma?

115
06:34.180 --> 06:35.270
She's fine.

116
06:35.270 --> 06:36.750
Just some superficial wounds.

117
06:36.750 --> 06:38.360
The doctor was concerned she might have a concussion,

118
06:38.360 --> 06:39.980
so he recommended keeping her in the hospital for observation.

119
06:39.980 --> 06:41.159
If nothing else comes up,

120
06:41.159 --> 06:42.420
she can be discharged.

121
06:42.920 --> 06:43.970
That's good.

122
06:44.450 --> 06:45.159
Where's Uncle?

123
06:45.159 --> 06:46.159
He was busy for a long time,

124
06:46.159 --> 06:47.180
so he went home.

125
06:47.750 --> 06:49.450
The old lady insisted on seeing you,

126
06:49.450 --> 06:51.180
so I had to call you over.

127
06:52.120 --> 06:53.380
It's okay, Mrs. Jiang.

128
06:53.680 --> 06:54.370
Where's Grandma?

129
06:54.370 --> 06:54.920
I'll go see her.

130
06:54.920 --> 06:55.659
In the ward.

131
06:55.659 --> 06:56.720
Come with me.

132
06:59.120 --> 06:59.920
Mom,

133
07:00.060 --> 07:01.310
look who's here.

134
07:04.660 --> 07:05.450
Yuan.

135
07:05.770 --> 07:07.220
Yuan, you're back.

136
07:07.660 --> 07:08.720
Are you on school break?

137
07:08.720 --> 07:10.370
Quick, sit down.

138
07:11.090 --> 07:11.880
Sit.

139
07:14.060 --> 07:14.860
Yes.

140
07:15.950 --> 07:18.550
I came to see you as soon as the holiday started.

141
07:20.180 --> 07:21.750
How are you feeling, Grandma?

142
07:21.750 --> 07:22.660
Does it hurt?

143
07:22.720 --> 07:23.650
It doesn't hurt.

144
07:24.250 --> 07:25.420
As soon as I see you,

145
07:25.750 --> 07:27.070
everything is fine.

146
07:28.240 --> 07:30.220
She hasn't been eating well lately

147
07:30.270 --> 07:31.770
and keeps getting cranky.

148
07:32.040 --> 07:33.900
I don't know what happened today.

149
07:33.930 --> 07:35.740
She just fell in the bathroom.

150
07:36.920 --> 07:39.010
Why are you telling him this?

151
07:39.930 --> 07:41.130
Okay, I won't say it.

152
07:42.950 --> 07:43.750
Yuan,

153
07:43.770 --> 07:45.480
it's so hard

154
07:45.680 --> 07:46.940
for me to get to see you.

155
07:47.480 --> 07:48.659
You only come back

156
07:48.659 --> 07:50.120
once in a long while.

157
07:50.480 --> 07:52.310
But you never stay long

158
07:52.310 --> 07:54.040
before you have to leave again.

159
07:56.690 --> 07:58.120
Do you have a lot

160
07:58.950 --> 08:00.270
going on at school?

161
08:01.420 --> 08:02.220
Or...

162
08:04.180 --> 08:05.510
are you dating someone?

163
08:07.520 --> 08:09.050
Once you have a girlfriend,

164
08:09.420 --> 08:10.980
you forget about me.

165
08:15.330 --> 08:17.060
I've just been too busy lately.

166
08:17.310 --> 08:18.620
When things settle down,

167
08:18.620 --> 08:19.950
I'll come see you often.

168
08:21.680 --> 08:23.180
If you're dating,

169
08:23.720 --> 08:25.810
you should spend time with the girl.

170
08:26.270 --> 08:27.430
Girls

171
08:27.540 --> 08:29.470
need someone to keep them company.

172
08:29.980 --> 08:31.010
When the time comes,

173
08:31.010 --> 08:33.010
just bring her back

174
08:33.010 --> 08:34.169
to meet me.

175
08:35.169 --> 08:35.740
Okay.

176
08:39.840 --> 08:40.840
Then promise me

177
08:41.440 --> 08:42.620
you'll eat well.

178
08:43.669 --> 08:44.480
Okay.

179
08:47.370 --> 08:48.170
Pinky swear.

180
08:49.530 --> 08:50.340
Pinky swear.

181
08:55.240 --> 08:57.570
Patient in bed two, time for your checkup.

182
08:57.590 --> 08:58.400
Okay.

183
09:00.060 --> 09:00.880
Take it easy.

184
09:01.080 --> 09:01.870
It's fine.

185
09:01.870 --> 09:02.530
Your shoes.

186
09:04.430 --> 09:05.050
Take it easy.

187
09:05.050 --> 09:05.670
Okay.

188
09:09.030 --> 09:10.770
Family members don't need to come along.

189
09:10.770 --> 09:11.480
After the checkup,

190
09:11.480 --> 09:12.910
we'll bring her back.

191
09:12.910 --> 09:13.320
Okay.

192
09:13.320 --> 09:14.170
Thank you.

193
09:19.120 --> 09:19.910
Shize,

194
09:20.820 --> 09:22.440
I'm really sorry

195
09:22.440 --> 09:24.510
for making you come all this way at night.

196
09:24.510 --> 09:26.080
I know you must be busy,

197
09:27.130 --> 09:28.740
so I won't hold you up.

198
09:28.740 --> 09:29.940
You should head back.

199
09:30.480 --> 09:31.740
It's fine, Mrs. Jiang.

200
09:32.240 --> 09:33.500
Taking care of Grandma

201
09:33.840 --> 09:35.080
is what I should do.

202
09:36.630 --> 09:38.160
We're here, so don't worry.

203
09:39.980 --> 09:40.770
Go back.

204
09:45.510 --> 09:46.910
I'm leaving, Mrs. Jiang.

205
09:58.460 --> 09:59.250
Uncle.

206
10:01.460 --> 10:02.440
Why are you here?

207
10:03.620 --> 10:05.840
I came to see Grandma.

208
10:07.240 --> 10:08.970
Whatever happens in our family

209
10:09.440 --> 10:10.900
has nothing to do with you.

210
10:15.840 --> 10:17.600
Do you know how she fell?

211
10:21.030 --> 10:22.030
Mrs. Jiang told me

212
10:22.630 --> 10:24.390
Grandma fell in the bathroom.

213
10:25.500 --> 10:27.700
She was just afraid you'd overthink it.

214
10:29.040 --> 10:30.170
Today, your grandma

215
10:30.630 --> 10:32.840
wanted to look at Yuan's childhood photos,

216
10:32.840 --> 10:35.240
so she stepped on a stool to open the cabinet

217
10:35.750 --> 10:36.600
and fell.

218
10:37.290 --> 10:38.750
On the way to the hospital,

219
10:38.750 --> 10:40.550
she even asked us not to tell Yuan

220
10:43.030 --> 10:44.960
because she was afraid he'd be sad.

221
10:45.240 --> 10:46.080
Don't think

222
10:47.270 --> 10:48.100
a quick visit here

223
10:48.100 --> 10:49.890
makes everything fine.

224
10:51.100 --> 10:53.230
You just want peace of mind, don't you?

225
10:53.500 --> 10:54.250
So you can go back

226
10:54.250 --> 10:55.630
to your own life.

227
10:55.960 --> 10:57.050
But we still have to

228
10:57.050 --> 10:58.750
bear all this mess ourselves!

229
11:02.460 --> 11:04.000
What are you doing, Jiang?

230
11:04.500 --> 11:05.490
We're in a hospital.

231
11:05.490 --> 11:06.270
Why were you yelling?

232
11:06.270 --> 11:07.870
You were disturbing others.

233
11:09.150 --> 11:10.810
Shize means well, doesn't he?

234
11:12.910 --> 11:13.790
Means well?

235
11:15.460 --> 11:16.890
Didn't he mean well back then

236
11:16.890 --> 11:19.030
when he offered to help take care of Yuan?

237
11:19.030 --> 11:20.360
And what was the result?

238
11:22.130 --> 11:23.290
We can't afford

239
11:23.960 --> 11:25.560
his kind of good intentions.

240
11:29.840 --> 11:30.630
I'm sorry.

241
11:32.890 --> 11:33.700
Shize,

242
11:33.700 --> 11:34.630
you go back.

243
11:34.630 --> 11:36.100
You've been tired for so long.

244
11:36.100 --> 11:36.960
You go back.

245
11:36.960 --> 11:37.790
Go back.

246
11:37.790 --> 11:39.250
Hurry, get back to your work.

247
11:39.250 --> 11:40.840
Stay away from our family from now on.

248
11:40.840 --> 11:41.630
Those who get close to you

249
11:41.630 --> 11:42.700
never end up well!

250
11:42.700 --> 11:43.200
What are you doing?

251
11:43.200 --> 11:44.150
You've already got Yuan killed.

252
11:44.150 --> 11:45.370
Don't harm anyone else!

253
11:45.370 --> 11:46.170
Shize.

254
11:47.840 --> 11:49.440
Look at what you said!

255
12:49.210 --> 12:50.000
Hello?

256
12:50.250 --> 12:51.050
Lili.

257
12:51.250 --> 12:52.500
How was the tutoring today?

258
12:52.500 --> 12:53.550
How did it go?

259
12:54.310 --> 12:55.450
Today is another day

260
12:55.480 --> 12:57.000
of unrequited love.

261
12:57.050 --> 12:58.250
Did you confess to him?

262
12:58.250 --> 12:58.960
Not yet.

263
12:58.960 --> 13:00.600
That would scare him away.

264
13:00.650 --> 13:02.050
Then why did you say that?

265
13:03.510 --> 13:05.390
I asked him silently in my heart.

266
13:06.460 --> 13:08.010
Didn't you two go to a cafe

267
13:08.010 --> 13:08.790
on a date?

268
13:10.100 --> 13:11.150
How did you know?

269
13:11.250 --> 13:12.860
It's all over the internet.

270
13:13.510 --> 13:15.310
Let me tell you something funny.

271
13:15.480 --> 13:16.820
While skateboarding, Fu Zhengchu

272
13:16.820 --> 13:18.220
saw the photos of you two,

273
13:18.290 --> 13:19.120
got mesmerized,

274
13:19.120 --> 13:20.460
and fell into a pit.

275
13:20.890 --> 13:21.820
Is it serious?

276
13:22.250 --> 13:23.340
He's fine.

277
13:23.800 --> 13:24.870
He just somehow

278
13:24.890 --> 13:26.360
ended up with a lifesaver.

279
13:26.390 --> 13:27.620
She called an ambulance for him

280
13:27.620 --> 13:29.410
and ran around taking care of everything, including the hospital bills.

281
13:29.410 --> 13:30.890
So considerate.

282
13:31.120 --> 13:33.000
He's lying in the hospital now,

283
13:33.120 --> 13:34.290
acting like an emperor,

284
13:34.290 --> 13:36.050
bossing me around.

285
13:36.050 --> 13:36.750
Tang Lin!

286
13:37.410 --> 13:38.270
I'm hungry.

287
13:40.390 --> 13:41.220
Heard that?

288
13:41.250 --> 13:42.910
The emperor has spoken again.

289
13:43.360 --> 13:44.820
Are you at the hospital?

290
13:44.820 --> 13:45.600
Yes.

291
13:46.050 --> 13:46.960
Hurry and go to EAW

292
13:46.960 --> 13:48.410
to look at the photos of you and Fu Shize.

293
13:48.410 --> 13:50.000
The netizens are going crazy.

294
13:50.000 --> 13:50.790
Okay.

295
13:51.050 --> 13:51.860
Bye-bye.

296
14:06.620 --> 14:09.670
These are actually pretty good photos.

297
14:12.320 --> 14:13.820
I bet 50 cents they're colleagues.

298
14:13.820 --> 14:15.130
Are you sure it's not her brother?

299
14:15.130 --> 14:15.700
Dating is fine,

300
14:15.700 --> 14:16.820
[Perfect match! $200 from me.] [Snacks out; stay tuned! Next.]

301
14:16.820 --> 14:18.130
but don't delay the updates, hear me?

302
14:18.130 --> 14:18.340
Next update, I want to see you two appear together next update.

303
14:18.340 --> 14:19.220
[Older or younger cousin? Three minutes to lie.]

304
14:19.370 --> 14:19.890
[I wanna see you appear together next update. Don't make me beg!]

305
14:19.890 --> 14:21.120
I'm late. Can someone explain?

306
14:21.120 --> 14:21.290
[Best wishes!]

307
14:21.290 --> 14:22.930
As long as you're happy. Congratulations.

308
14:22.930 --> 14:23.050
[Alright, I approve of this match.]

309
14:23.050 --> 14:23.480
What a match. Here's 200 for the wedding.

310
14:23.480 --> 14:24.040
[Just a stranger who wandered into frame. OP, share the original for proof.]

311
14:24.040 --> 14:24.990
[Front row]

312
14:24.990 --> 14:26.370
It's blurry. Obviously a relative.

313
14:26.370 --> 14:27.050
[Doesn't Idle Cloud have a younger brother?]

314
14:27.050 --> 14:27.280
Doesn't Idle Cloud have a younger brother?

315
14:27.280 --> 14:28.150
[Are you sure it's not her brother?]

316
14:28.270 --> 14:29.340
Okay, next one.

317
14:29.910 --> 14:31.720
So embarrassing.

318
15:06.570 --> 15:09.300
[Jiang Yuan] [The total score indicates a severe depressive tendency.]

319
15:22.290 --> 15:23.100
Have you been

320
15:24.960 --> 15:26.560
under a lot of stress lately?

321
15:27.750 --> 15:28.480
No.

322
15:33.510 --> 15:35.220
Maybe it's because my paper is due soon,

323
15:35.220 --> 15:36.720
so I'm a bit anxious.

324
15:37.460 --> 15:38.240
It's fine.

325
15:49.700 --> 15:51.250
There are 3 kinds of medicine in total.

326
15:51.250 --> 15:52.890
Take this bottle in the morning,

327
15:52.890 --> 15:54.820
and the other two boxes before bed.

328
15:55.050 --> 15:56.310
Make sure to take them.

329
15:57.600 --> 15:58.730
I'll remind you too.

330
16:01.860 --> 16:02.890
Got it.

331
16:12.020 --> 16:13.680
Your dad specifically told me

332
16:14.440 --> 16:15.840
to take good care of you.

333
16:19.510 --> 16:20.710
If you need anything,

334
16:21.820 --> 16:22.960
you must tell me.

335
17:04.440 --> 17:05.240
Xia.

336
17:05.510 --> 17:07.160
You didn't go to the hospital?

337
17:07.160 --> 17:09.220
Tang Lin told me Fu Zhengchu fell.

338
17:09.550 --> 17:11.010
I just finished checking in a guest.

339
17:11.010 --> 17:12.130
I'm about to go.

340
17:12.150 --> 17:13.250
