523
29:56.960 --> 29:58.050
You've already got Yuan killed.

524
29:58.050 --> 29:59.380
Don't harm anyone else!

525
30:25.880 --> 30:26.530
Sorry.

526
30:29.460 --> 30:30.350
Maybe my behavior

527
30:30.350 --> 30:31.680
