675
39:15.480 --> 39:15.650
Let me dry you, too.

676
39:15.650 --> 39:18.620
♪ This damp murmur ♪

677
39:18.910 --> 39:23.380
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

678
39:24.040 --> 39:26.280
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

679
39:26.280 --> 39:27.070
Yun Lili.

680
39:27.420 --> 39:28.260
♪ My heart spreads onward ♪

681
39:28.260 --> 39:29.400
Thank you

682
39:30.910 --> 39:32.070
♪ Rain falls, and grief runs aground ♪

683
39:32.070 --> 39:33.730
for letting me meet you again.

684
39:36.470 --> 39:38.230
♪ Nothing but remembrance ♪

685
39:38.440 --> 39:41.600
♪ Maybe someday ♪

686
39:41.630 --> 39:44.520
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

687
39:44.640 --> 39:49.940
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

688
39:49.940 --> 39:51.840
I finally made it to his side.

689
39:52.630 --> 39:54.010
In my world,

690
39:54.530 --> 39:55.730
as long as he is there,

691
39:56.120 --> 39:57.380
the moon will be there.

692
39:58.580 --> 40:00.080
I should be braver

693
40:00.720 --> 40:02.070
and try one more time.

694
40:03.490 --> 40:05.550
I don't want to have any more regrets.

695
40:50.460 --> 40:51.060
I'm sorry.

696
40:51.600 --> 40:52.200
It's okay.

697
41:58.900 --> 41:59.950
Fu Shize.

698
42:03.550 --> 42:05.880
I went back and thought about it all night.

699
42:10.610 --> 42:12.540
I've decided to think it over again

700
42:13.750 --> 42:15.270
before deciding whether to give up.
